    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405640/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1755085422\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405640/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1755085422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405640/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1755085422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405640/extras/37a6cb81c7ad0f644561218d308e2ee8.poster.avif?t=1755085422\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405640/extras/37a6cb81c7ad0f644561218d308e2ee8.webm?t=1755085422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405640/extras/37a6cb81c7ad0f644561218d308e2ee8.mp4?t=1755085422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Enter the bleak world of VISK, an online co-op horror game for 1-2 players.<br>You and your friend are sent to a desolate village.<br>Uncover the dark secrets of this place and cautiously explore your surroundings.<br>After all, you might not be alone\u2026<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with a friend or in single player</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>2 player online co-op mode</strong><br>    Play alongside your friend and cooperate to progress.<br>    Work together using walkie-talkies and proximity voice-chat.<br></li><li><strong>Single player mode</strong><br>    Go into this dreary experience alone.<br>    No one will come to help you.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405640/extras/2b68054d4db54d26fb3e1ed27ef1b7a1.poster.avif?t=1755085422\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405640/extras/2b68054d4db54d26fb3e1ed27ef1b7a1.webm?t=1755085422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405640/extras/2b68054d4db54d26fb3e1ed27ef1b7a1.mp4?t=1755085422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the truth</h2><br>Who sent you here? What happened to this village? Are you really alone?<br>Discover unique environments as you search for answers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405640/extras/c45a32281f4f461e362faa6febab0cf9.poster.avif?t=1755085422\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405640/extras/c45a32281f4f461e362faa6febab0cf9.webm?t=1755085422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405640/extras/c45a32281f4f461e362faa6febab0cf9.mp4?t=1755085422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the past</h2><br>Solve puzzles, search for key items and interact with the environment to gain access to new places.<br>Search for remains of a past life and figure out what happened here. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405640/extras/b5aed14af8fc9984c1d6401149c09abf.poster.avif?t=1755085422\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405640/extras/b5aed14af8fc9984c1d6401149c09abf.webm?t=1755085422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2405640/extras/b5aed14af8fc9984c1d6401149c09abf.mp4?t=1755085422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
